---
layout: base.njk
title: 제품소개
---
<section class="gradient-hero grid-overlay relative pt-20 pb-16 md:pt-24 md:pb-20">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    <p class="text-sm font-bold text-techblue-300 tracking-wider mb-3">PRODUCTS</p>
    <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white leading-snug">디씨테크 제품 라인업</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto">설비 진단 현장에서 바로 쓸 수 있도록 개발된 디씨테크의 제품을 소개합니다.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-slate-50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
    {% if collections.products | length %}
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      {% for item in collections.products %}
      <a href="{{ item.url }}" class="card-hover block bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
        {% include "product-card-media.njk" %}
        <div class="p-6">
          {% if item.data.category %}
          <span class="inline-block text-xs font-bold text-techblue-500 bg-techblue-50 rounded-full px-3 py-1 mb-3">{{ item.data.category }}</span>
          {% endif %}
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-navy-900 mb-2">{{ item.data.title }}</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed line-clamp-3">{{ item.data.summary }}</p>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-semibold text-techblue-500 mt-4">
            제품 자세히 보기
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </span>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="text-center py-20">
      <p class="text-slate-400">등록된 제품이 없습니다.</p>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white text-center">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-navy-900 mb-4">제품 도입이나 견적이 궁금하신가요?</h2>
    <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">설비 환경에 맞는 구성과 견적을 안내해 드립니다.</p>
    <a href="/contact/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-techblue-500 hover:bg-techblue-400 text-white font-semibold px-8 py-3.5 rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-techblue-500/20 transition-colors">
      제품 문의하기
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
